{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09238","headline":"答故人见谕 · 韦应物","name":"答故人见谕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素寡名利心，自非周圆器。\n徒以岁月资，屡蒙藩条寄。\n时风重书札，物情敦货遗。\n机杼十缣单，慵疎百函愧。\n常负交亲责，且爲一官累。\n况本濩落人，归无置锥地。\n省己已知非，枉书见深致。\n虽欲效区区，何由枉其志。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09238.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09238","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}